## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to specify per-tenant containment and safe routing, a core llm-ops skill.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant policy isolation
- Prompt containment and redaction
- Routing to model variants
- Atomic policy updates and testability

## Code Example
```javascript
function applyPolicy(tenantId, prompt) {
  const policy = policyStore[tenantId];
  if (policy?.blocks?.some(b => prompt.includes(b))) return {blocked: true};
  let redacted = prompt;
  policy?.redacts?.forEach(r => {
    redacted = redacted.replace(new RegExp(r, 'g'), '[REDACTED]');
  });
  const routeModel = policy?.routeModel ?? 'balanced';
  return {blocked: false, redactedPrompt: redacted, routeModel};
}
```

